[{"title":"送胡大灵携其门人与幼子作客青齐 其三","author":"何绛","text":"暂从驰驿走红尘，此去何劳更问津。\n齐国倘逢缧绁士，不妨重作解骖人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41818,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送詹仙舟计偕 其一","author":"何绛","text":"千腋狐裘赭白骄，关门风雪正萧萧。\n鴐鹅天上先传信，万乘应逢廿四桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41819,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送詹仙舟计偕 其二","author":"何绛","text":"延陵季子近如何，到日应知几笑歌。\n莫怪山中叹寥寂，青云渐属故人多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41820,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孟行弟北上 其一","author":"何绛","text":"冬月梅花斗雪新，一枝折赠计偕人。\n北梅不似南梅好，灼灼先开万国春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41821,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孟行弟北上 其二","author":"何绛","text":"三策天人掞俊才，锦袍新映杏花开。\n三年省觐知应免，刚好而翁又到来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41822,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送颖斯侄孙作幕新宁","author":"何绛","text":"永日衙斋客况闲，题诗为我解离颜。\n莫嫌尺一书难达，青鸟犹能认故山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41823,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻泽春弟于桃溪西偏新开绿墅先拟绝句一首寄之","author":"何绛","text":"石路斜通薜荔墙，碧桃深闭读书堂。\n落花满地何曾扫，尽得游人屐齿香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41824,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿滋广上人石湖精舍 其一","author":"何绛","text":"数间茅屋小桥东，野衲无言鸟语风。\n清磬一声禅定后，柴门深闭藕花中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41825,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿滋广上人石湖精舍 其二","author":"何绛","text":"纡回石路月高低，曲槛层楼隔柳堤。\n惆怅西园重到客，一宵瓜地听乌啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41826,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白山上人新筑退居落成 其一","author":"何绛","text":"茅堂新筑寺垣西，修竹千竿绕碧溪。\n满径落花无过客，磬声才歇鸟声啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41827,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白山上人新筑退居落成 其二","author":"何绛","text":"最好凉秋九月天，细风疏雨小窗前。\n老僧独坐心无事，懒说时流言句禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41828,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白山上人新筑退居落成 其三","author":"何绛","text":"数亩清池竹下开，放生鱼去鸟飞回。\n閒云更自怜孤寂，偏向穷山日日来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41829,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白山上人新筑退居落成 其四","author":"何绛","text":"满目平田飞鹧鸪，晚风斜日好相呼。\n白头老衲当窗坐，眼处闻声会得无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41830,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿黄澹轩 其一","author":"何绛","text":"人日新莺树树回，觥船交错绮筵开。\n梅花正傍君头白，喜得清香岁岁来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41831,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿黄澹轩 其二","author":"何绛","text":"精神龙马雪盈头，踪迹曾同大隐流。\n何必中山千日醉，百壶春酒问罗浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41832,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿黄母郭太君","author":"何绛","text":"青鸟传将七月信，瑶池树色正苍苍。\n蓬莱清浅秋风动，金母西来见穆王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41833,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿广慧上人","author":"何绛","text":"白发蓬松老古锥，诸方参遍也无疑。\n归来稳坐尖头屋，破衲萧萧识者谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41834,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿文昌林君卫 其一","author":"何绛","text":"海漆花开春复春，茫茫岛上住閒身。\n谁言往事多虚诞，千载鸡窠尚有人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41835,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿文昌林君卫 其二","author":"何绛","text":"奇甸西看是十洲，仙人来往几时休。\n閒从石上观鱼井，鱼我相忘对白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41836,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潘子登以诗扇见赠赋此答之","author":"何绛","text":"每开纨扇诵佳章，暑月风寒夜有光。\n不是昔年浮海客，珠玑安得满奚囊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41837,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿羽四邹广文 其一","author":"何绛","text":"清歌妙舞玳筵开，痛饮龙胎五色醅。\n萼绿侍君曾二载，玉盆仙枣旧携来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41838,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿羽四邹广文 其二","author":"何绛","text":"吾爱君才比郑虔，词章落纸如云烟。\n诸生侍讲环门立，雨雪都忘满院前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41839,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈太守还燕 其一","author":"何绛","text":"五载清风遍草莱，何堪今日送君回。\n最怜夹毂双双鹿，犹为行春特地来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41840,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈太守还燕 其二","author":"何绛","text":"四望重重烟雾遮，单车此去向谁家。\n争知海国从今后，只对棠梨几树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41841,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慧海上人住静西山精舍余以足疾未能应招闻其陂池林木之胜作此寄之 其一","author":"何绛","text":"孤城东望水迢迢，病客空劳远见招。\n虽是远公初住锡，松枝闻偃已多朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41842,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慧海上人住静西山精舍余以足疾未能应招闻其陂池林木之胜作此寄之 其二","author":"何绛","text":"细风吹雨过池亭，閒诵金刚般若经。\n幽鸟渐知人出食，双双戢羽立疏棂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41843,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜独坐寄谦长侄","author":"何绛","text":"月上空阶雪色寒，病夫无力欲行难。\n何时得共幽园里，细把禅心坐夜阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41844,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠李少君 其一","author":"何绛","text":"香车曾记入门时，萼绿梅花始上枝。\n薄发千条初覆额，为郎搦管写乌丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41845,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠李少君 其二","author":"何绛","text":"柳腰梅额指如葱，绣罢春衫倦唾绒。\n尽道海棠花似妾，试将优劣问东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41846,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠桃溪主人新宠 其一","author":"何绛","text":"粉朱赤白不容加，洛浦分明上晓霞。\n薄发千条长委地，何人不共惜名花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41847,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠桃溪主人新宠 其二","author":"何绛","text":"或时小饮醉颜酡，一寸横波转顾多。\n善谑乱□□薄技，几翻因笑不成歌。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41848,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠洞玄上人 其一","author":"何绛","text":"青鞋布衲法僧装，却忆当年忝雁行。\n今日相逢重相笑，直须指点过当阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41849,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠洞玄上人 其二","author":"何绛","text":"白发门前送汝行，堪伤十载倚闾情。\n寒潭有月亲须悟，正好归来唤到明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41850,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠洞玄上人 其三","author":"何绛","text":"临流照影影依稀，大士当头彻悟机。\n要识前身双树下，与谁朝出夜深归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41851,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁彩凤药室","author":"何绛","text":"口松东岸石桥南，前馆窗开对碧潭。\n夜月渐低朝管歇，方书高枕两三函。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41852,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜怀周范山","author":"何绛","text":"□旅客难寐，寒螀夜夜心。\n非关怜节序，因此每沉吟。\n薄俗肝胆少，斯人意气深。\n如何江山去，欲涉雨淫淫。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41853,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"失题 其一","author":"何绛","text":"青山寂寂月空明，玉轸朱丝彻夜清。\n铁干参差横屋角，梅花尽入曲中鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41854,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"失题 其二","author":"何绛","text":"铁笛一声山上寒，岭云溪月夜漫漫。\n敬亭已落梅花遍，独有桓伊兴未阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41855,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"失题 其三","author":"何绛","text":"萼绿华来环佩光，千山夜静百花香。\n于遮舞雁都歌罢，无事瑶台归去忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41856,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀故园诸子","author":"何绛","text":"独立开明镜，因之感叹长。\n二年身作客，三月鬓飞霜。\n问道悲年老，逢人忆友良。\n那堪离索者，留滞尚他乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41857,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远公自石桥精舍罢讲初归作","author":"何绛","text":"松花久向云中食，黄叶无端逐水流。\n尘世是非何处尽，归来犹及小山秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题文昌阁","author":"何绛","text":"画栋丹楹倚翠峦，萧疏松竹对江干。\n不须远望衣冠气，辅锦山头尽巨观。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿冲虚观","author":"何绛","text":"古坛秋尽菊花新，落木千章绕四邻。\n葛令丹台犹未改，白家音乐已难陈。\n天鸡夜半争啼日，仙犬年多不吠人。\n却忆昨宵闻颇异，空中一曲随梁尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老榕","author":"何绛","text":"肿壅盘空上，滋培天地恩。\n不知巢凤翥，自觉像龙蟠。\n盛暑炎成戢，高天白日昏。\n栋梁非我任，留荫在平原。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答赠中都李司马","author":"张家珍","text":"南国有佳士，翩翩鸿鹄姿。\n独宿慕俦侣，高举淩天涯。\n万里云海心，寄托良可知。\n我居罗浮下，息驾怀希夷。\n匣剑久不鸣，木石性所怡。\n清江枉兰桨，叩我岩下扉。\n我去采灵药，还当与君期。\n毫素见幽襟，一字堪一思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"失题","author":"张家珍","text":"泠泠江水深，水深千万尺。\n登楼有所思，所思在行客。\n期我春风时，春风期已迫。\n人生几何时，晷运如过隙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌生八九子","author":"张家珍","text":"深谷有郁林，繁城多芳躅。\n盛衰各有故，所分在显伏。\n不见城头树上乌，巢有八九雏。\n高栖远啄身乐妻子腴，智则不足灵有馀。\n曾噪将军树，又集大夫居。\n告人凶吉，亡己安危。\n世人自福不汝德，世人招祸则汝责。\n吁嗟汝乌何不呼雏辞南飞去北，从今勿攫道傍肉。\n续弦断竹，世上机关备险毒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古","author":"张家珍","text":"妾家南海傍，青春兰芷香。\n堕马梳成吴后髻，织腰学作楚宫妆。\n自别阿郎难记时，空帷不复整蛾眉。\n春风白昼帘不卷，紫燕双飞高下窥。\n错问阿郎郎不语，对镜两人空泪垂。\n不见十年颜色老，落花满地伤怀抱。\n妾上高楼望楚云，郎在湘江怨芳草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41865,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野梅","author":"张家珍","text":"离离照水清且彻，粉脸迎风寒欲绝。\n从来傲骨故难柔，那肯低头避霜雪。\n自揣良非鼎俎资，瘦影惟堪对明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41866,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈元孝","author":"张家珍","text":"孤窗有月亭如雪，不见故人空见月。\n相思杳在天际头，鸿雁一声生白发。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41867,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"张家珍","text":"黄昏古树鸦欲栖，平沙饮马空中嘶。\n我来城市心悲栖，欲归不归望长堤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41868,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晴月","author":"张家珍","text":"木杪云初亮，山前瀑布寒。\n光辉今夜倍，圆缺几人看。\n柳影池心乱，琴声露气漙。\n含情与谁语，惆怅夜漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41869,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尹右民下第归过讯","author":"张家珍","text":"野树分秋色，庭花坐似春。\n青云原不坠，绿蚁且相亲。\n耻下荆山泪，同生杵臼身。\n丈夫恩未报，终是有心人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41870,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀人","author":"张家珍","text":"林下觉凉早，披衣过漏声。\n关河今夕戍，秋月想同情。\n世乱无家好，身劳遇物轻。\n知君重意气，西向拂龙精。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋怀高望公","author":"张家珍","text":"去岁山中月，心闲共薜萝。\n如何今夕酒，不见故人过。\n露叶飘幽砌，寒虫隐绿莎。\n相思愁嘿嘿，凝望渺沧波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞云顶九日","author":"张家珍","text":"朝随僧饭后，策杖上层峦。\n满目川原小，蘧然天地宽。\n深秋金涧静，返照玉峰寒。\n却怪龙山燕，空传落帽欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋至","author":"张家珍","text":"秋至一何好，新凉气候清。\n井梧当槛落，海月入窗明。\n燕别草堂垒，鸿流关塞声。\n天涯有知己，此夜念孤征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同诸子游深溪龙潭","author":"张家珍","text":"十年梦此地，今日始寻源。\n云暖桃花发，岩欹瀑水喧。\n空山眠野鹿，风断啸寒猿。\n共坐澄潭下，幽思不可言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上元宿半座庵","author":"张家珍","text":"寺隐山将暮，良宵不忍眠。\n松花香塔后，溪水到门前。\n隔岸山歌起，诸村烟火连。\n冷然僧梵后，深坐一灯悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中登楼","author":"张家珍","text":"穷居亦何意，言笑向人难。\n二月登楼望，孤村细雨寒。\n行云变岩岫，流水异波澜。\n闭户宜今日，春愁且自宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行","author":"张家珍","text":"不尽青山意，寻幽任所之。\n溪行三十里，日出几何时。\n云响樵何处，钟声寺不知。\n此中堪小隐，当与古人期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望罗浮","author":"张家珍","text":"日暮海天白，罗浮云气重。\n诸山皆隐跃，独现老人峰。\n雨足新溪水，苔封古寺踪。\n当时茅屋上，应长几株松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边竹屋 其一","author":"张家珍","text":"寂寂溪边屋，阴阴古木繁。\n开门看瀑水，终日自潺湲。\n野鸟啼空谷，桃花发古村。\n一身安乐好，何处报人恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边竹屋 其二","author":"张家珍","text":"溪流清且彻，曲曲绕柴关。\n石鼠昼出没，幽禽时往还。\n苔深人迹少，气壮酒杯閒。\n倚槛聊长望，云开山上山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠穆之兄","author":"张家珍","text":"古侠吾兄重，世人无不闻。\n徒闻不能识，老此鹿麋群。\n彩笔摇川岳，干将倚白云。\n晚成宜大器，天地任纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居 其一","author":"张家珍","text":"久不出城市，幽居道自尊。\n云深溪欲雨，树密昼常昏。\n懒性惟依枕，看山辄启门。\n悠然人境外，流水自潺湲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居 其二","author":"张家珍","text":"山居少邻并，田父两三家。\n夹岸流莺好，当门绿柳斜。\n春畦迟播谷，松径早收茶。\n最喜新晴步，溪头踏野花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬澹归和尚","author":"张家珍","text":"端水衣冠地，离群感昔年。\n浮云自朝暮，往事在山川。\n飞锡庐山上，浮杯粤海边。\n相思定何处，松月照寒泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中岁暮怀友","author":"张家珍","text":"王孙当岁暮，迟滞故园归。\n五老峰头住，悠然歌采薇。\n閒脩高士传，常着比丘衣。\n独有罗浮侣，同看春草肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尹右民作先文烈行状诗以谢之","author":"张家珍","text":"岳渎郁奇气，东南挺大儒。\n鸿章俪典训，高行重师谟。\n言念先文烈，挥毫绍董狐。\n精忠如可述，公道岂曾孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅月","author":"张家珍","text":"日落月复生，升沉感慨并。\n古今俱若此，旅夜难为情。\n潮水三更起，村鸡历乱鸣。\n镆铘时一拂，寂寞壮心惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与黎务光兄弟夜话","author":"张家珍","text":"秋风正萧瑟，秋雨更凄凄。\n世事不能测，深山当稳栖。\n逃名有巢许，抗节本夷齐。\n共是牢骚者，愁听子夜鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41889,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林孟易昆玉山堂落成诗以赠之","author":"张家珍","text":"山园卜筑静，门对大江开。\n花木繁阴处，罗浮翠色来。\n青毡空故物，黄卷属多才。\n不负先人意，弟兄君子哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41890,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]